MODULE: RepairCursorOnlyAfterCompletionCursorFirst
TARGET: RepairCursorOnlyAfterCompletion
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: The repair cursor advances before the fallible whole-tree RPC.
PERTURBS: RepairStart
--- FIND
    /\ busy' = TRUE /\ work' = 0
    /\ UNCHANGED <<phase, cursor, dirty, baseline, fingerprint, pendingBaseline,
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: skip the failed tree on retry.
    /\ busy' = TRUE /\ work' = 0 /\ cursor' = cursor + 1
    /\ UNCHANGED <<phase, dirty, baseline, fingerprint, pendingBaseline,
--- END
